Rule 5 (if the first tensor has a higher dimension than the second 1D tensor, the last dimension of the first tensor must match the size of the second tensor or the second tensor's size must be 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, 0) ∨ shape(v_2, 0) = 1
