Rule 10 (if the first input tensor is not a scalar, its first dimension must be comparable with the integer value of the second parameter)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then shape(v_1, 0) > v_2 ∨ shape(v_1, 0) ≤ v_2
