Rule 11 (if the second input tensor is not a scalar, its first dimension must be comparable with the float value of the first parameter)
{v_1 : float, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_2) > 0 then shape(v_2, 0) > v_1 ∨ shape(v_2, 0) ≤ v_1
